        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Thermodynamic modeling of mafic magmas in rhyolite-MELTS to develop a novel pressure estimation tool. Calibration of this geobarometer showed key issues in how mafic minerals are modeled in rhyolite-MELTS and indicate a need to alternative approaches for estimating pressure.",
